---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 24
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: What the Activity stream shows
    accDescr: A run, scheduled or by hand, that changed something adds one entry for the target user, with the counts of its changes and links to its first five files and to the archive folder. Every file of the inbox that Paperless imported adds an entry with a link to its new document in Paperless, every file that Paperless failed to import one with the reason and a link to the file in the error folder, and every file that Paperless refused one with the reason, as the file stays in the inbox. A dry-run and a run without changes add none.

    run(["`⚙️ Run<br>*scheduled or by hand*`"])
    changes["`🔔 One entry for the run<br>*added or updated 3 documents,<br>moved 1 document: a.pdf, b.pdf …*`"]
    inbox["`📂 Files of the inbox<br>*whose tasks or uploads<br>Paperless answered*`"]
    none["`∅ No entry<br>*for a dry-run or<br>a run without changes*`"]
    imported["`📥 One entry per import<br>*scan.pdf was imported<br>into Paperless as P123*`"]
    failed["`⚠️ One entry per failed import<br>*the reason of Paperless,<br>the file in the error folder*`"]
    refused["`⛔ One entry per refusal<br>*the reason of Paperless,<br>the file stays in the inbox*`"]

    run -- "files changed" --> changes
    run --> inbox
    run -. "nothing changed" .-> none
    inbox -- "imported" --> imported
    inbox -- "failed" --> failed
    inbox -- "refused" --> refused

    classDef nextcloud fill:#0082c92e,stroke:#0082c9,stroke-width:2px
    classDef paperless fill:#17803d2e,stroke:#17803d,stroke-width:2px
    classDef warning fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef refused fill:#c9302c1f,stroke:#c9302c,stroke-width:2px
    class run,changes,inbox nextcloud
    class imported paperless
    class failed warning
    class refused refused
